06)------Projection: CAST(unbounded_t.c1 AS Int64) + Int64(1) AS c1
07)--------TableScan: unbounded_t projection=[c1]
08)--Union
09)----MaterializedCteScan: name=u
10)----MaterializedCteScan: name=u
