06)--Projection: a.k
07)----Inner Join: a.s = b.s
08)------SubqueryAlias: a
09)--------Limit: skip=0, fetch=2
10)----------MaterializedCteScan: name=c
11)------SubqueryAlias: b
12)--------Projection: c.s
13)----------MaterializedCteScan: name=c
physical_plan
