02)--ProjectionExec: expr=[k@0 as k, sum(t.v)@1 as s]
03)----AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[k@0 as k], aggr=[sum(t.v)]
04)------RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([k@0], 4), input_partitions=1
05)--------AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[k@0 as k], aggr=[sum(t.v)]
06)----------DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]
